// ║                                                                  ║
// ║  AUTO MANAGEMENT FEATURES:                                      ║
// ║  ✅ Partial TP — 50% closed at TP1, 50% at TP2/TP3             ║
// ║  ✅ Trailing Stop — follows price, locks in profit              ║
// ║  ✅ Breakeven Stop — SL moves to entry after TP1 hit           ║
// ║  ✅ Early Exit — closes trade on reversal signal                ║
